<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <title>Your weekly ConfidenceUp report</title>
</head>
<body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: #0f172a; line-height: 1.6;">
  <h1 style="color: #7c3aed;">Your week in ConfidenceUp</h1>
  <p>Hi {{name}},</p>
  <p>Here is your speaking practice summary for the last 7 days:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Sessions completed:</strong> {{sessionsCount}}</li>
    <li><strong>Average confidence score:</strong> {{avgConfidence}}</li>
    <li><strong>Best score:</strong> {{bestScore}}</li>
    <li><strong>Current streak:</strong> {{streak}} days</li>
    <li><strong>Strongest dimension:</strong> {{topDimension}}</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Keep building momentum with one short practice today.</p>
  <p>— The ConfidenceUp team</p>
</body>
</html>
